            <interp corresp="fifty-second_year">The fifty-second year of King Zhaoxiang of Qin, 255 BC. The square brackets are the editors': the graphs are damaged on the slip and restored.</interp>
            <interp corresp="Zhang_Lu">张禄: the name Fan Ju went by in Qin. The Chronicle gives his death in the same year as Wang Ji's execution, which the Table records.</interp>
